      "comment": "SNITCH ADAMS (8) comes off an average run last start when seventh at Geelong over 460m behind Rothwell Bonnie (26.86) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Looks the one to beat on his best form. HEAD OF STAFF (1) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 5th (25.05) at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Key player if finds best. OUR MABEL (4) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 2.25 lengths into second (24.42) at Traralgon in a Grade 5 over 425m. Hard to beat again. TILLY GIRL (5) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
